  (text "GaN synchronous buck converter - the circuit simulated in sim/buck.cir" (at 36 26 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.6 2.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0250eff8-b7c5-4857-bd54-364f9d68273c"))
  (text "100 V in, 50.0 V out at 500 kHz.  Values read from the netlist at build time." (at 36 32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1159b447-b129-4f9c-b74c-8745c60e94c4"))
  (text "Qhs / Qls are enhancement-mode GaN HEMTs. KiCad has no GaN symbol, so an" (at 36 160 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e9f351ab-3572-49d9-9f32-e9c257981947"))
  (text "n-channel enhancement MOSFET symbol is used, as in EPC's own schematics." (at 36 164 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f7a97c19-e820-46b4-9b56-c03c1579f1d0"))
  (text "The device has NO BODY DIODE - reverse conduction during dead time costs" (at 36 168 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9d878d19-f4da-4bdb-a832-b904e2d5da9d"))
  (text "Vth + |Voff| + I*Rds(on), not one diode drop. This sets the dead-time trade." (at 36 172 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3d380c12-2714-49fc-b3df-13b8f05ec2c0"))
  (text "Ldec / Cdec / Rdec is the bus decoupling. Rdec = 1 ohm is a damping value," (at 36 180 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "574c9fd0-3e9b-4946-a19a-92f9f90b4e67"))
  (text "not a parasitic: at 20 mOhm this branch rings at ~22 MHz and drove the" (at 36 184 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c951eba9-5e8f-4480-9641-717abc1a5869"))
  (text "low-side gate to +11.8 V against a 1.4 V threshold at a 200 V bus." (at 36 188 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0e898f8f-feed-4634-9e27-a8d531f31153"))
  (text "HSG / LSG come from the segmented gate driver (8 pull-up + 8 pull-down" (at 36 196 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0c2ac6c9-196a-4fcd-ad25-bc180e5382e4"))
  (text "slices, active Miller clamp, -2 V off rail) driven by seg_gate_ctrl.v." (at 36 200 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c3b07d36-1043-4ef9-88ec-38dcfcc2f123"))
  (text "Not drawn: Vsin, Vshs, Vsls, Vsout are 0 V sources in the netlist used" (at 36 208 0)
